The initial Zenodo search did not return relevant papers on forest fire management in India or the Himalayas; the results were unrelated (global governance, medical imaging, education, e-commerce, and horticulture). I will now broaden the search using Crossref to find specific academic literature on this topic.

TOOL_CALL: crossref_search
ARGS: {"query": "forest fire management India Himalayas", "rows": 10}

The direct DOI link for the EGU25-831 paper returned a JavaScript-heavy landing page rather than the full text. I will attempt to fetch the PDF or full text from the specific DOI link provided in the abstract, or try a different paper from the list that might have a more accessible PDF link. Let's try the paper by Mina et al. (2023) which seems to have a direct Springer/BMC link structure, and the Jamwal (2025) paper.

TOOL_CALL: fetch_url
ARGS: {"url": "https://doi.org/10.1186/s42408-023-00177-4"}
